       >>SOURCE FORMAT IS FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. SYMBOL.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
    01 SY-I PIC 9(4).
LINKAGE SECTION.
    COPY "compiler-state.cpy".
    01 SY-LOOKUP-NAME PIC X(64).
    01 SY-FOUND PIC X.
PROCEDURE DIVISION USING COMPILER-STATE SY-LOOKUP-NAME SY-FOUND.
MAIN-SYMBOL.
    MOVE "N" TO SY-FOUND
    PERFORM VARYING SY-I FROM 1 BY 1
        UNTIL SY-I > CS-SYMBOL-COUNT
        IF CS-SYMBOL-NAME(SY-I) = SY-LOOKUP-NAME
            MOVE "Y" TO SY-FOUND
            EXIT PERFORM
        END-IF
    END-PERFORM
    GOBACK.
